{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ中国シリーズ、\n2日目岡山！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして蘭世の誕生日でした(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意志が強くて\n自分に負けない蘭世が\nカッコよくて凄い素敵。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/23/4239983/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何故か伊織がこのポーズを考えました。笑\nでもこのポーズ好きかも。可愛い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年はケーキが貰えなかったという蘭世。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日祝えてよかった\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(でも私も今年ケーキ貰ってない...\n撮影では戴いたけど...\nメンバーと写真撮ってない...悲しかった...)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/23/4239983/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恒例のご当地シール〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメラで撮ったから\n私にだけピントが合ってしまって\n後ろがぼけちゃった( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんねみんな( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/23/4239983/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はポニーテールにしたよ(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブらしく、涼しげ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シークレットグラフィティーに\nぴったりの髪型だと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のダンスじゃまだ足りないと\n個人的に思ったので\n今日は昨日よりもパキパキに\n踊ってみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場も奥行きがあったので\n後ろの人まで届くようにと( ˘ω˘ )。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと気を付けたのは姿勢！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華のダンスしてる時の姿勢が\nとても綺麗で目を惹くので\nそんな風になりたいな〜と思って( ˘ω˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付いてくれた方1人でもいてくれたら\n嬉しいなあ(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も沢山のタオルと\n赤青のサイリウム、団扇が多くて\n本当に嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でももっとちはるーむめいとが\n増えて貰えるように頑張る(> <)。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もとっても楽しかったです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岡山ありがとう(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"因みにコールは、「ちはる！」で\nお願いします\\( ˆoˆ )/♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構皆さんの声聞こえてるんだよ〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「寝癖」クリープハイプさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌詞の世界観が独特！\nでもそれが良い。\n\"君の髪が白くなっても\n側にいたいと思ってるよ\"\nの部分が好き！\n歳を取っても変わらぬ愛情が\n素敵。カッコいい〜\n街中で手を繋いでる\nおじいちゃんおばあちゃんが\n私は大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/23/4239983/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなアップルマンゴーを食べながら\n今日の公演の反省会を1人でします( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当これ美味しいんだよ〜\nハマるよ〜〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間に明日がラスト！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後悔しないようなライブを\nみんなで創っていきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみましょう(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}